  "answer": "For nonstop BOS → ZRH on 2026-10-09 under $900, the fare that includes a checked bag is **Economy Standard** on flight **WA101**.\n\n- **WA101 (BOS 18:05 on 2026-10-09 → ZRH 07:40 on 2026-10-10)**\n  - **Economy Standard** (**WA101-20261009-STANDARD**) — **$858 per passenger total**; includes **1 checked bag (23 kg)**, plus **8 kg cabin bag** and a **personal item**. Changes are allowed for **$150 per passenger plus any fare difference**. Refunds are **non-refundable**.\n\nThe **Economy Basic** options (**WA101-20261009-BASIC** and **WA105-20261009-BASIC**) include **no checked bag (0)** (they’re **non-refundable** and don’t allow changes).",
